  (text "J3: 1 +5V, 2 GND, 3 RX (<- TXD do conversor), 4 TX (-> RXD do conversor), 5 DTR. Conversor CH340G com DTR, em 5 V." (at 12.7 275.59 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d8f8f8a4-e8ed-4f5a-bd7d-9c4183c66d34)
  )
  (text "J4: com R18 = 4,7k o conversor ganha do modulo no RX: grava com o HC-05 encaixado. Com R18 = 0 e LED7, tire o modulo. 115200 (AT). HC-06 nas vias 2-5." (at 12.7 278.13 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid a5088dd6-6a51-444b-9289-46bb07256460)
  )
  (text "J5: bootloader com Arduino Uno + ArduinoISP (D10 -> RST, D11 -> MOSI, D12 -> MISO, D13 -> SCK, 10 uF no RESET do Uno)." (at 12.7 280.66999999999996 0)
